<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ussy Lifestyle - Fashion Brand</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{background:#FFF8F0;color:#111}
header{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:14px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100}
.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1px}
.logo span{color:#FF6B9D}
header nav{display:flex;gap:14px}
header nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
.cart-btn{background:#FF6B9D;color:#fff;border:none;padding:9px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111 0%,#FF6B9D 100%);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:48px 20px}
.hero h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1}
.hero h1 span{color:#FFD166}
.hero p{margin:14px auto;max-width:600px;line-height:1.6;color:#eee}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.hero-btns button{padding:13px 22px;border-radius:25px;border:none;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.btn-pink{background:#FF6B9D;color:#fff}
.btn-white{background:#fff;color:#111}
.badge-row{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.badge-row span{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px}
.filters{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 16px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.filter-btn{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.filter-btn.active{background:#111;color:#fff}
.section{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:10px 16px 30px}
.section h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:6px}
.section p{color:#666;margin-bottom:16px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);cursor:pointer}
.card-img{height:210px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:80px}
.card-body{padding:16px}
.card-body h3{font-size:17px}
.card-body p{font-size:13px;color:#777;margin:6px 0}
.price-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
.price{font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#FF6B9D}
.old{font-size:13px;color:#aaa;text-decoration:line-through;margin-left:6px}
.add-btn{background:#111;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.about{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:36px 20px;text-align:center}
.about h2{font-size:28px}
.about p{color:#ccc;max-width:650px;margin:12px auto;line-height:1.7}
.about-grid{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.about-grid div{background:#222;padding:16px;border-radius:14px;width:200px}
.about-grid b{color:#FFD166}
.testi{max-width:1100px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 16px}
.testi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.testi-card{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);line-height:1.6}
.testi-card b{color:#FF6B9D}
.newsletter{background:#FFD166;padding:30px 20px;text-align:center}
.newsletter input{padding:13px;border:none;border-radius:10px;width:260px;max-width:80%;outline:none}
.newsletter button{background:#111;color:#fff;border:none;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px}
footer{background:#111;color:#aaa;text-align:center;padding:24px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
.socials{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}
.socials a{background:#fff;color:#000;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px}
.cart-box{position:fixed;right:12px;top:70px;width:320px;max-width:92vw;background:#fff;color:#111;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);padding:16px;display:none;z-index:200}
.cart-box h3{margin-bottom:10px}
.cart-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;font-size:14px}
.cart-total{font-weight:900;font-size:18px;margin:12px 0}
.checkout-btn{background:#25D366;color:#fff;border:none;width:100%;padding:13px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}
.clear-btn{background:#eee;border:none;width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px}
#toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#111;color:#fff;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:700;display:none;z-index:300}
@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.testi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:32px}header nav{display:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">USSY <span>LIFESTYLE</span></div>
<nav>
<a href="#shop">Shop</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
<a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
<button class="cart-btn" id="cartBtn" type="button">🛒 Cart (<span id="cartCount">0</span>)</button>
</header>
<div class="hero">
<p style="letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:800;">✨ NEW COLLECTION 2026 ✨</p>
<h1>Wear Your <span>Confidence.</span><br>Live The Lifestyle.</h1>
<p>Streetwear, luxury & everyday fashion for Lagos babes & guys. Quality wey go last, price wey make sense. Delivery to all Nigeria.</p>
<div class="hero-btns">
<button class="btn-pink" id="shopNowBtn" type="button">Shop Now 🛍️</button>
<button class="btn-white" id="whatsappBtn" type="button">Chat on WhatsApp 💬</button>
</div>
<div class="badge-row">
<span>🚚 Fast Delivery Lagos</span>
<span>💯 Quality Guaranteed</span>
<span>💳 Pay on Delivery</span>
<span>🔄 Easy Exchange</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="filters" id="shop">
<button class="filter-btn active" type="button" data-cat="All">All</button>
<button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-cat="Women">👗 Women</button>
<button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-cat="Men">👕 Men</button>
<button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-cat="Shoes">👟 Shoes</button>
<button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-cat="Bags">👜 Bags</button>
<button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-cat="Accessories">⌚ Accessories</button>
</div>
<div class="section">
<h2>🔥 Trending Now</h2>
<p>Best sellers this week - e dey go fast, order now before e finish.</p>
<div class="grid" id="productGrid"></div>
</div>
<div class="about" id="about">
<h2>About Ussy Lifestyle</h2>
<p>Ussy Lifestyle na fashion brand from Lagos wey believe say style no be about money, na about confidence. We bring you clean, classy and street-ready outfits wey fit for church, party, school, date and everyday slay.</p>
<div class="about-grid">
<div><b>5000+</b><br>Happy Customers</div>
<div><b>200+</b><br>Designs</div>
<div><b>36 States</b><br>We Deliver</div>
